id: sacrificial-mark
name: Sacrificial Minion
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 99
# Not a Combat Condition: Sacrificial Minion (2)'s third choice - its 2(T) as stacks, set (it cannot stack), till the end of your turn.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Sacrificial Minion: Combat Rolls higher by a point a stack, till the end of your turn.
text: >
  Sacrificial Minion (2): Increase your Combat Rolls by 2(T) until the end of your turn. This effect cannot stack.

---

[passive per stack]
combatRolls += 1;
